-- Crisp standard library prelude (spec §15)
-- Documentation mirror; live symbols are compiler-injected (see crisp-resolve).

-- Core types: ?T, Result<T,E>, str, vec, map, set
-- IO: std.io, std.fs, std.net.parse_ip; HTTP via rust=true crates (e.g. ureq)
-- Concurrency: std.async, std.sync, std.atomic
-- Traits (injected): Show.show, Eq.equal, Ord.compare → Display / PartialEq / Ord
-- Still deferred: Hash, Clone, Copy, Drop, Default, Into, From, Iterator; std.http server API
